  "description": "Meta-package for the HealthData.Interop FHIR R4 toolkit. Bundles FHIR client services, US Core validation, SMART on FHIR auth, CSV-to-FHIR ETL, HIPAA-aware security examples (RBAC, PHI masking, audit), and drift detection. Depends on HealthData.Interop.Abstractions, HealthData.Interop.Logging.Extensions, and HealthData.Interop.Logging.Serilog. Provided as-is; does not by itself ensure HIPAA compliance.",
